message: "If you use this code, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Deep learning applications on omics data and diagnostics: notebooks from a master's thesis"
abstract: >-
  Jupyter notebook implementations from the master's thesis "Deep Learning
  Applications on Biological Data" (Kadir Has University, Computational Biology
  and Bioinformatics, 2018). Softmax regression, feed-forward neural networks
  and LSTM models are applied to four public biological and medical datasets:
  Anuran call recordings, thyroid patient records, E. coli protein localisation,
  and HIV-1 protease cleavage sites.
type: software
